//
// Bambu's RTL backend is not written with Verilator's lint checks in mind
// (unused ports/parameters from generic component templates, mixed
// blocking/non-blocking styles, etc.). None of this is X-HEEP's own code to
// fix -- waive it wholesale for the generated sources only.
// hw/fpga/hls/bambu/dot_product's hand-written integration code
// (rtl/dot_product_hls_adapter.sv, rtl/dot_product_ctrl_regs.sv and the
// shared hw/fpga/hls/common/dot_product/dot_product_xheep_wrapper.sv) is
// deliberately NOT covered here: its warnings are fixed at the source instead.

`verilator_config

lint_off -file "*/hw/fpga/hls/bambu/dot_product/rtl/hls/*"
